	(text_box "Hub on its straps: CFG_SEL[1:0] = 00 (100k to GND), NON_REM[1:0] = 00 (the pins' own pull-downs):\n  self-powered, one TT per port; OCS_N left on their pull-ups (the expander reads each FAULT).\n  PRTPWR unused: the switches follow the expander, not the hub.  VBUS_DET on 3.3 V (host always attached).\nExpander pins are inputs at power-up: the EN pull-ups power every port, RESET/BOOT float.\nINT (J1.1 → the node's IO4): both expanders' INT and the four INA226 ALERTs, open drain, wired-OR.\nLead: the node's J7 mirrored, one 'Same direction' PH 8 cable.  The upstream pair has no ESD here: the\n  lead stays plugged inside the drawer, the node protects its own end."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 264.16 0)
		(size 406.4 20.32)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "76087683-7d1c-5406-ac61-a11a27fc1c6c")
	)
